            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You can take the form of a plant creature. Add the forms listed in plant form to your wild shape list; if you don't have wild shape, you can instead cast plant form once per day, heightened to the highest spell level you can cast. Whenever you're polymorphed into another form using wild shape, you gain resistance 5 to poison."
